<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 454)</h2>
<p><b>⌘Z, finished properly.</b></p>
<ul>
<li><b>Undo never swallows ⌘Z it can't act on.</b> If the Edit menu has no session in hand, it now steps aside so ⌘Z reaches the viewer's own undo — the path that has always worked — instead of quietly doing nothing.</li>
<li>Completes the fix from 452 and 453: ⌘Z takes back your typing while you're in a text mark, and your last mark everywhere else.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
