<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 453)</h2>
<p><b>⌘Z while typing a text mark.</b></p>
<ul>
<li><b>Fixed: ⌘Z did nothing while you were typing into a text annotation.</b> Build 452 stopped that from crashing, but left the key doing nothing at all in the one place you'd most reflexively reach for it. It now takes back your typing, as it should.</li>
<li>Undo and Redo stay live and decide what they mean at the moment you press them: your typing while a field has focus, your last mark everywhere else.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
